  </revision>
  <revision rev="2" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>b2fc5f44df1f9f27a67e4633d393c548</srcmd5>
    <version>0.0.22</version>
    <time>1791306865</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 0.0.22 (upstream release 2026-10-04)
- New receiver chains: BeiDou B1C/B2a RNSS, QZSS L1 C/B, SBAS L1
- Opt-in RTK from RTCM 3 corrections via an NTRIP caster, with new integer ambiguity resolution
- RINEX 4.02 output via PVT.rinex_version=4; the default stays 3.02
- The new CUDA engine is not in this build: ENABLE_CUDA defaults OFF, no CUDA/cuFFT symbols
- VOLK subpackage renamed libvolk_gnsssdr0_0_21 -&gt; libvolk_gnsssdr0_0_22 (SONAME .so.0.0.22)
- No Obsoletes: without a matching Provides, which would cost badness
- RTKLIB and the NTRIP client are in-tree: no new BuildRequires, TLS is OpenSSL
- The armv7l and 16.0 unresolvable results predate this change; no BuildRequires moved</comment>
    <requestid>1382537</requestid>
